WEBVTT

00:00:23.959 --> 00:00:26.756
♪ When this moment come to us ♪

00:00:26.975 --> 00:00:29.344
♪ The Stars will always shine ♪
[Full-Time Magister 3]

00:00:29.759 --> 00:00:33.599
♪ The light travels through
the horizon to you ♪

00:00:33.644 --> 00:00:35.971
♪ Right now light it up
follow your heart, yeah ♪

00:00:45.748 --> 00:00:48.724
♪ Our dream of madness is rattling ♪

00:00:48.725 --> 00:00:50.720
♪ Just cause you feel it possible ♪

00:00:50.772 --> 00:00:55.266
♪ My eyes will open wide
in this cold, dark night ♪

00:00:55.847 --> 00:00:58.483
♪ The heart bound by time
is just a shackle ♪

00:00:58.484 --> 00:01:00.634
♪ You said that dreams will never fall ♪

00:01:00.635 --> 00:01:03.893
♪ You put on the wings for me ♪

00:01:03.923 --> 00:01:08.055
♪ Braving through the wind ♪

00:01:09.590 --> 00:01:12.374
♪ When this moment comes to us ♪

00:01:12.386 --> 00:01:14.686
♪ My heart will no longer be lost ♪

00:01:15.263 --> 00:01:19.400
♪ I carry the weight of stars
and moon as I search for you ♪

00:01:19.426 --> 00:01:21.826
♪ You summon me from the dream ♪

00:01:21.827 --> 00:01:24.875
♪ My ambition is burning on ♪

00:01:24.876 --> 00:01:27.499
♪ You are the hope of light
in my darkest night ♪

00:01:27.500 --> 00:01:29.094
♪ On the other end of shine ♪

00:01:29.095 --> 00:01:31.613
♪ Let it all out and fight ♪

00:01:31.614 --> 00:01:34.735
♪ Shine bright like
it's the end of the world ♪

00:01:34.813 --> 00:01:37.281
♪ The Stars is burning through the sky ♪

00:01:37.295 --> 00:01:39.165
♪ Your hands are now ♪

00:01:39.166 --> 00:01:40.699
♪ Burning ♪

00:01:41.047 --> 00:01:44.738
♪ Fight against all odds
of our generation ♪

00:01:45.983 --> 00:01:49.951
♪ Fight against all odds
of our generation ♪

00:01:50.805 --> 00:01:53.419
♪ Fight against all odds
of our generation ♪

00:02:04.359 --> 00:02:05.532
Has he gone crazy?

00:02:05.573 --> 00:02:06.603
He's too arrogant.

00:02:06.696 --> 00:02:09.110
He looks down upon 5,000 of us at all.

00:02:09.876 --> 00:02:12.876
Even as a Level 2 mage,
I don't have the courage to say that.

00:02:12.974 --> 00:02:15.203
Mo Fan, you're too arrogant.

00:02:15.444 --> 00:02:17.532
We have to teach him a lesson!

00:02:17.545 --> 00:02:18.916
He's obviously too naive!

00:02:18.917 --> 00:02:20.286
He thinks he's great!

00:02:21.127 --> 00:02:22.607
If I want to practise
the four magic talents...

00:02:22.661 --> 00:02:24.437
without any resources,

00:02:24.769 --> 00:02:26.329
I won't be able to achieve anything.

00:02:26.378 --> 00:02:29.338
Since there's a great opportunity now,

00:02:29.464 --> 00:02:31.371
shouldn't I give it a try...

00:02:31.411 --> 00:02:33.250
and not let the opportunity
slip away?

00:02:33.827 --> 00:02:36.542
I'll do my best to become
the greatest mage.

00:02:39.128 --> 00:02:40.233
Let's fight together.

00:02:41.272 --> 00:02:43.174
I don't like snobs like him.

00:02:43.241 --> 00:02:45.184
Buddies, let's go and defeat him!

00:02:47.160 --> 00:02:48.298
Come on!

00:02:50.446 --> 00:02:51.593
Hiss of Fire, Explode!

00:02:52.853 --> 00:02:54.760
-Wave Plane Collapse!
-Storming Ice!

00:03:25.649 --> 00:03:27.278
Go on!

00:03:34.076 --> 00:03:35.089
My name is Zhuang Lifeng.

00:03:35.132 --> 00:03:36.746
I've been upset at you...

00:03:36.772 --> 00:03:38.368
since you went on stage.

00:03:38.562 --> 00:03:41.291
I'll let you know how great
the Zhuang family is.

00:03:42.485 --> 00:03:44.420
Finally someone from
a noble family appeared.

00:03:52.275 --> 00:03:54.458
First, I'll destroy your beast
that acted tyrannically.

00:03:54.459 --> 00:03:56.477
Then, I'll teach you a lesson.

00:04:12.989 --> 00:04:14.268
Zhuang Lifeng, good job!

00:04:14.656 --> 00:04:15.830
Tie him down, I'll help you!

00:04:16.060 --> 00:04:18.742
We can't let him take away
all of our resources.

00:04:18.976 --> 00:04:20.608
Hiss of Fire, Explode!

00:04:32.634 --> 00:04:34.660
Ignore that Wind Talent mage.

00:04:34.700 --> 00:04:36.340
Deal with the others first.

00:04:38.348 --> 00:04:40.559
Twining Vine!

00:04:43.171 --> 00:04:45.166
-Good job!
-Botany Talent?

00:04:45.505 --> 00:04:48.079
Do you think
I'm only a Wind Talent mage?

00:04:48.913 --> 00:04:49.980
Interesting.

00:04:50.209 --> 00:04:52.543
Unfortunately, you couldn't
draw the complete Starchart.

00:04:52.647 --> 00:04:53.780
You're a mere Level 1 mage.

00:04:53.824 --> 00:04:55.544
Don't even think about winning over
my Archwolf.

00:05:04.565 --> 00:05:07.526
Fool. I won't just attack
your Summoning Beast.

00:05:10.470 --> 00:05:13.054
This is against the rules. How could
you attack the Summoner directly?

00:05:14.583 --> 00:05:15.703
The competition was originally held...

00:05:15.758 --> 00:05:17.825
as a battle between the Summoning Talent
and other talents.

00:05:18.198 --> 00:05:19.305
The target...

00:05:19.670 --> 00:05:21.167
wasn't stated clearly.

00:05:26.061 --> 00:05:27.604
Is it the Thunder Magic?

00:05:27.605 --> 00:05:29.655
I didn't say I wasn't a Level 2 mage.

00:05:29.673 --> 00:05:31.285
Thunder Magic, Thunderstorm!

00:05:40.372 --> 00:05:42.492
He is also a Thunder Talent mage.

00:05:43.167 --> 00:05:45.626
He has an Intermediate Level Archwolf
and is skilled in Thunder Magic.

00:05:45.780 --> 00:05:47.155
Nobody can defeat him.

00:05:47.189 --> 00:05:49.789
We can slowly deplete
the energy of the Archwolf.

00:05:53.504 --> 00:05:55.437
I can't look down on each
and every one of them.

00:05:55.801 --> 00:05:57.468
There must be more Level 2 mages here.

00:05:58.255 --> 00:05:59.922
No matter what level you are,

00:06:00.184 --> 00:06:02.179
I won't show my mercy.

00:06:16.215 --> 00:06:17.461
He reached the quota?

00:06:17.462 --> 00:06:19.321
The number is still increasing.

00:06:19.322 --> 00:06:20.508
If this goes on,

00:06:20.537 --> 00:06:22.884
he may defeat everyone alone.

00:06:28.990 --> 00:06:31.082
Chancellor, he defeated 150 mages.

00:06:31.374 --> 00:06:32.761
If he really defeats 200 mages,

00:06:32.814 --> 00:06:35.007
will we hand him all the resources?

00:06:38.040 --> 00:06:39.461
We don't even know his origins.

00:06:39.500 --> 00:06:42.113
How dare he behave atrociously
in Mingzhu City?

00:06:42.490 --> 00:06:45.475
Bai Cangfeng, you're the earliest mage
that can control the Starchart among us.

00:06:45.685 --> 00:06:47.058
We'll give you the chance...

00:06:47.159 --> 00:06:48.212
to show yourself.

00:06:48.332 --> 00:06:49.494
Of course.

00:06:49.557 --> 00:06:51.904
I'll have to advise the rest of you
to pay attention to training.

00:06:51.971 --> 00:06:55.058
Or else, next time you'll still be
sitting here and talk like a coward.

00:06:55.795 --> 00:06:57.608
I'll go and stop him now.

00:06:57.898 --> 00:06:59.045
I'll let them know...

00:06:59.152 --> 00:07:01.430
the Bai family is the most powerful
family in Mingzhu City.

00:07:04.039 --> 00:07:07.079
I thought my nephew could be patient.

00:07:07.375 --> 00:07:08.575
Even the Bai family acted.

00:07:08.812 --> 00:07:10.281
We should stop the tumult.

00:07:10.334 --> 00:07:13.376
The Bai family doesn't care about
the resources given to the new students.

00:07:13.620 --> 00:07:16.033
He acted because
he saw Mingzhu Academy...

00:07:16.075 --> 00:07:17.279
being humiliated.

00:07:19.690 --> 00:07:20.663
You're Mo Fan, right?

00:07:20.917 --> 00:07:23.211
Cangfeng, we love you!

00:07:24.271 --> 00:07:25.271
I have to say,

00:07:25.292 --> 00:07:28.918
with your ability, you can win over most
of the freshmen in Mingzhu Academy.

00:07:29.021 --> 00:07:30.287
You're intelligent too.

00:07:30.417 --> 00:07:33.335
You used your level to
gain more resources.

00:07:33.547 --> 00:07:36.827
If you offend students
without any connections,

00:07:36.841 --> 00:07:38.048
nothing will happen.

00:07:38.077 --> 00:07:39.263
But, don't forget.

00:07:39.334 --> 00:07:42.376
There are many new students
from noble families.

00:07:42.662 --> 00:07:43.729
These noble...

00:07:48.145 --> 00:07:49.292
Why are you so talkative?

00:07:49.305 --> 00:07:50.399
You're acting like a woman.

00:07:55.882 --> 00:07:57.028
My...

00:07:57.220 --> 00:07:58.361
Armour Self-defense Weapon!

00:07:58.411 --> 00:07:59.291
Armour...

00:08:18.140 --> 00:08:20.320
Scoundrel, I'll kill you!

00:08:20.853 --> 00:08:22.173
You're eliminated.

00:08:22.262 --> 00:08:24.443
Why? I have an
Armour Self-defense Weapon.

00:08:24.482 --> 00:08:25.775
I don't need your protection.

00:08:25.882 --> 00:08:27.079
Based on what happened,

00:08:27.292 --> 00:08:29.459
are you sure you can operate it stably?

00:08:29.844 --> 00:08:30.831
This is hilarious.

00:08:30.923 --> 00:08:32.896
He was eliminated before he even acted.

00:08:33.222 --> 00:08:35.765
He talked non-stop too.
But, he lost badly.

00:08:36.430 --> 00:08:38.239
Mo Fan, I'll kill you!

00:08:38.782 --> 00:08:39.769
You don't respect your elders.

00:08:46.248 --> 00:08:47.034
You can go on.

00:08:48.052 --> 00:08:49.907
We worked hard to practise
the Summoning Talent,

00:08:50.081 --> 00:08:51.580
but it's not his first talent?

00:08:51.647 --> 00:08:54.908
Moreover, his Thunder Talent
is in Level 2.

00:08:56.451 --> 00:08:58.540
-Nobody dares to go against him?
-I want to.

00:08:58.541 --> 00:08:59.936
But, I'm not capable enough to do so.

00:09:01.416 --> 00:09:02.430
199.

00:09:02.523 --> 00:09:03.550
Anyone else?

00:09:05.277 --> 00:09:05.930
You...

00:09:20.364 --> 00:09:21.430
Someone is going to challenge him.

00:09:21.806 --> 00:09:22.632
It's Mu Nujiao!

00:09:31.812 --> 00:09:34.441
-Calm down.
-It's Mu Nujiao!

00:09:34.442 --> 00:09:35.821
She's challenging him!

00:09:35.880 --> 00:09:36.868
A goddess!

00:09:37.191 --> 00:09:38.177
My nose is bleeding.

00:09:38.218 --> 00:09:39.034
Give me a tissue paper.

00:09:40.937 --> 00:09:41.977
I'll challenge you.

00:09:41.991 --> 00:09:42.930
You're Mu Nujiao?

00:09:43.340 --> 00:09:44.459
Let's discuss.

00:09:45.915 --> 00:09:48.089
You're the last person
that I have to challenge.

00:09:48.142 --> 00:09:49.409
I can feel that...

00:09:49.472 --> 00:09:50.699
you're strong.

00:09:55.068 --> 00:09:55.935
Let me phrase it this way.

00:09:56.219 --> 00:09:56.953
If you win,

00:09:57.125 --> 00:10:00.084
you'll save the tiny bit of
resources for your department.

00:10:00.455 --> 00:10:01.288
But, if I win,

00:10:01.902 --> 00:10:03.154
I'll get the resources
of all faculties and departments.

00:10:04.896 --> 00:10:05.696
So?

00:10:06.277 --> 00:10:07.590
You'll get 30 percent and
I'll get 70 percent of the resources.

00:10:07.617 --> 00:10:09.574
-What do you think?
-You're adorable.

00:10:10.018 --> 00:10:11.578
You fought hard until now.

00:10:11.637 --> 00:10:13.664
But, you're willing to give me
30 percent of what you'll get?

00:10:15.142 --> 00:10:16.062
Let's be friends.

00:10:16.676 --> 00:10:19.783
As a man who adores and pursues beauty,

00:10:19.917 --> 00:10:22.343
I don't mind giving out
worldly possessions.

00:10:23.300 --> 00:10:25.902
Then, what if I want 70 percent
of the resources?

00:10:26.044 --> 00:10:27.017
You don't know your place.

00:10:27.413 --> 00:10:29.585
Don't use petty tricks.
Let's begin.

00:10:31.578 --> 00:10:33.898
No wonder there are rumours
saying that you're a goddess...

00:10:33.924 --> 00:10:34.991
and loves to fight like a devil.

00:10:35.057 --> 00:10:36.106
The rumours are true.

00:10:36.360 --> 00:10:38.106
Since you want it the hard way,

00:10:38.132 --> 00:10:39.283
then, come on!

00:10:47.307 --> 00:10:48.759
Wind Shroud, Twister!

00:10:49.694 --> 00:10:51.345
50 percent. That's the most I can offer!

00:11:07.693 --> 00:11:09.226
Run to where the wind is slow.

00:11:19.744 --> 00:11:20.968
Archwolf, come back!

00:11:22.994 --> 00:11:23.286
You...

00:11:23.777 --> 00:11:24.857
Are you hitting the Wind Shroud?

00:11:25.458 --> 00:11:26.245
No!

00:11:37.013 --> 00:11:37.947
Rise.

00:11:46.394 --> 00:11:47.933
It's fine...

00:11:48.026 --> 00:11:49.696
It's a rare Summoning Beast.

00:11:49.898 --> 00:11:50.991
I won't act ruthlessly.

00:11:51.637 --> 00:11:52.731
Thank you for sparing its life.

00:11:52.757 --> 00:11:54.548
But, I won't concede defeat.

00:11:54.891 --> 00:11:56.425
Then, show your true abilities.

00:11:59.095 --> 00:12:00.622
Archwolf, go back and rest.

00:12:20.334 --> 00:12:22.668
The Lightning Bolt is different
from your Wind Shroud.

00:12:22.883 --> 00:12:24.822
Straight from the sky!

00:12:27.133 --> 00:12:28.519
Neat and efficient!

00:12:28.885 --> 00:12:30.171
Wind magic, Floating shadow!

00:12:34.147 --> 00:12:35.160
How capable she is.

00:12:35.280 --> 00:12:36.387
She can avoid the Lightning Bolt.

00:12:37.610 --> 00:12:39.930
Before this, I arranged
the Wind Trajectory around this area.

00:12:40.526 --> 00:12:42.167
Looks like you're going to lose.

00:12:42.784 --> 00:12:43.570
Really?

00:12:43.584 --> 00:12:45.876
Your Wind Shroud, Twister is far away.
When it reaches me,

00:12:45.941 --> 00:12:47.009
I can avoid it.

00:12:47.295 --> 00:12:49.802
Did I say I'm going to use Wind Magic?

00:12:49.935 --> 00:12:51.680
Forest Prison!

00:13:23.740 --> 00:13:26.420
The Battle of the Beasts...

00:13:26.542 --> 00:13:30.126
became a battle between Level 2 mages.

00:13:32.602 --> 00:13:34.021
The goddess showed her capabilities...

00:13:34.022 --> 00:13:35.926
and killed that evil mage!

00:13:35.943 --> 00:13:38.037
We nearly lost our resources.

00:13:38.056 --> 00:13:41.213
From today onwards,
she'll be my goddess!

00:13:50.976 --> 00:13:51.763
Concede defeat.

00:13:52.771 --> 00:13:53.610
Where is he?

00:13:59.008 --> 00:13:59.959
How could this be possible?

00:14:00.247 --> 00:14:02.367
Nobody can escape from my Forest Prison.

00:14:06.007 --> 00:14:07.126
You lost.

00:14:09.573 --> 00:14:10.560
Shadow Talent?

00:14:10.855 --> 00:14:12.442
How is it possible for you to master
the Shadow Talent?

00:14:15.428 --> 00:14:17.661
Don't bother about that.
Now, what should you say?

00:14:17.848 --> 00:14:20.326
-Do you know?
-I lost.

00:14:43.098 --> 00:14:44.565
Chancellor Xiao, well...

00:14:44.566 --> 00:14:45.984
What should we do?

00:14:45.985 --> 00:14:48.782
Why don't we advise Mo Fan to give up?

00:14:49.023 --> 00:14:50.679
Or else, it will affect  a lot.

00:14:53.167 --> 00:14:55.918
Alright,the Battle of the Beasts
has come to an end.

00:14:55.943 --> 00:14:56.937
Chancellor Xiao.

00:14:57.136 --> 00:14:59.189
Actually, the public resources
that will be given out...

00:14:59.229 --> 00:15:02.151
won't affect your training.

00:15:02.492 --> 00:15:04.332
You can't accept the fact that...

00:15:04.345 --> 00:15:06.694
these will be taken by one person only.

00:15:07.083 --> 00:15:09.542
Did you forget what
I said during the opening?

00:15:10.751 --> 00:15:13.418
It's time for the rules to be changed.

00:15:14.090 --> 00:15:15.396
Today, I'm glad.

00:15:15.663 --> 00:15:18.212
Although it's still far from
the world being changed,

00:15:18.513 --> 00:15:20.606
at least this is a good start.

00:15:20.637 --> 00:15:22.640
Chancellor Xiao, did you think about...

00:15:22.692 --> 00:15:24.277
students like us who are poor...

00:15:24.334 --> 00:15:27.043
and need to rely on the academy's
resources to continue training?

00:15:27.558 --> 00:15:28.851
Since you asked that,

00:15:28.984 --> 00:15:30.332
then I can tell you.

00:15:30.876 --> 00:15:35.001
The obnoxious person
who just took your resources...

00:15:35.336 --> 00:15:37.199
comes from Bow City.

00:15:38.101 --> 00:15:39.155
Chancellor Xiao,

00:15:39.207 --> 00:15:40.409
I was quietly minding my own business.

00:15:40.469 --> 00:15:42.453
But, you revealed my origins
without my permission.

00:15:42.454 --> 00:15:43.463
This isn't good.

00:15:43.986 --> 00:15:44.866
I announce that resources...

00:15:45.125 --> 00:15:49.584
for all faculties and departments in
this semester will belong to Mo Fan.

00:15:49.721 --> 00:15:51.196
Mo Fan, you did it!

00:15:51.197 --> 00:15:52.408
You did a wonderful job!

00:15:52.421 --> 00:15:54.261
You made the Summoning Faculty proud.

00:16:07.172 --> 00:16:09.004
Zhao Manyan, where are our roommates?

00:16:11.667 --> 00:16:12.827
They moved out.

00:16:12.987 --> 00:16:14.548
Moved out? Why?

00:16:14.553 --> 00:16:17.361
What else? They were scared of you.

00:16:17.643 --> 00:16:18.789
I scared them?

00:16:19.816 --> 00:16:23.028
Friend, although you showed off this time,

00:16:23.273 --> 00:16:25.060
you also offended many people.

00:16:25.817 --> 00:16:26.746
So what?

00:16:27.186 --> 00:16:30.709
Look, you don't get well with others
like the noble family members.

00:16:30.793 --> 00:16:31.780
What do you mean?

00:16:32.206 --> 00:16:33.286
Don't you know?

00:16:33.433 --> 00:16:34.773
After the Battle of the Beasts,

00:16:34.876 --> 00:16:36.918
Mu Nujiao took the responsibility of ...

00:16:36.950 --> 00:16:38.363
the Battle for freshmen.

00:16:38.599 --> 00:16:40.412
Using the name of the Mu family,

00:16:40.439 --> 00:16:43.416
she donated a huge amount of resources
to every faculty and department.

00:16:43.839 --> 00:16:45.401
Why did she do so?

00:16:45.487 --> 00:16:46.487
Not only you,

00:16:46.580 --> 00:16:48.750
but also the academy
didn't expect her to do so.

00:16:49.350 --> 00:16:51.095
-It's all about profits.
-How?

00:16:51.676 --> 00:16:53.766
Come, I'll teach you all about it.

00:16:54.244 --> 00:16:57.078
Every year, the noble families will use
a huge amount of resources...

00:16:57.078 --> 00:16:59.877
to get the students graduating
from famous academies.

00:17:00.005 --> 00:17:02.870
They even reserve students
that are still studying.

00:17:03.186 --> 00:17:05.479
The Mu family is using the resources...

00:17:05.519 --> 00:17:06.653
earlier than usual.

00:17:07.094 --> 00:17:09.084
They want to buy over
all the freshmen at one go.

00:17:10.459 --> 00:17:11.555
After all, they are a noble family.

00:17:11.556 --> 00:17:12.624
They are generous.

00:17:12.696 --> 00:17:14.683
They sacrificed a lot.

00:17:16.417 --> 00:17:19.209
Although not every student of
Mingzhu Academy will succeed,

00:17:19.260 --> 00:17:20.887
there is a high chance
for them to succeed.

00:17:21.042 --> 00:17:24.334
Even if many students
don't join the Mu family,

00:17:24.383 --> 00:17:26.116
their reputation is good.

00:17:26.539 --> 00:17:27.834
It's worth it for them.

00:17:27.835 --> 00:17:30.202
Zhao Manyan, you're something.

00:17:31.195 --> 00:17:32.075
Mo Fan,

00:17:32.127 --> 00:17:35.401
how did you escape from
the Level 2 Botany Magic?

